==English==

===Etymology===
{{glossary|spelling pronunciation|Spelling pronunciation}} of {{bor|en|sco|MacKenȝie}} with the letter [[yogh]] confused with ''Z''. Ultimately from {{bor|en|gd|Mac Coinnich}}, itself from {{compound|gd|mac|Coinneach|alt2=Coinnich|t1=son, descendant|t2=of Coinneach|nocat=1}}.

